OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry launched after shot fired
OL,4,Aat house
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter a man shot at a property in
OL,8,FSheffield, according to police.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to a property on
OL,11,FElmham Road in Darnall after reports of
OL,12,Fa firearms discharge between 10:30 and
OL,13,F11:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,15,FPolice said a male passenger had got
OL,16,Fout of a silver Mercedes, shot at the
OL,17,Fproperty and then been driven away.
OL,19,FOfficers later found evidence of a
OL,20,Ffirearms discharge at the scene but no
OL,21,Finjuries were reported, they said.
